    Bug 1839356 - Remove (some) Preferences.sys.mjs usage from Thunderbird code. r=freaktechnik

    This gets rid of the easiest ones.
    There is some more complex ones in calendar, and some slightly complex in mail - but such that we can copy over from Firefox when they fix theirs.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D248442

